  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Medical Team response to nightclub fire</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">At around 03:00 local time on Sunday 16 March, a fire broke out in a warehouse nightclub venue in the eastern city of Kocani, around 80km from the capital Skopje, in North Macedonia. FCDO quickly mobilised its Emergency Medical Team (EMT) to support. The intervention is having real impact. The EMT has inserted itself into the heart of the decision making process in the Macedonian and International system, influencing high quality decision making and giving the UK a (disproportionately large) seat around the table</narrative>
  </description>
